       AND `the order is made by the Secretary of State`
       AND `the order is made for the purposes of subsection (1)(h)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“prescribed” means prescribed, or of a description prescribed, by order made by the Secretary of State for the purposes of subsection (1)(h)"

